msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.meta_service.metrics_url` | str | `http://127.0.0.1:8000` | No | "
"http(s)://<host>:<port>, port [1025, 65535] | Metrics URL. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.meta_service.metrics_url` | str | `http://127.0.0.1:8000` | 否 | "
"http(s)://<host>:<port>，端口 [1025, 65535] | 指标 URL。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.log_level` | str | info | No | debug / info / warn / error | Log "
"level; shared by MetaService and LocalService. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.log_level` | str | info | 否 | debug / info / warn / error | "
"日志级别；由 MetaService 和 LocalService 共享。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.evict_threshold_high` | int | 90 | No | [1, 99] (percentage) | "
"High watermark of the secondary (L2) pool; eviction is triggered when this "
"watermark is reached, and only when `usedSize * 100 > totalSize * "
"threshold`. When SSD is enabled, 70 is recommended to improve SSD cache hit "
"rate. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.evict_threshold_high` | int | 90 | 否 | [1, 99]（百分比） | "
"二级（L2）池的高水位线；达到该水位线时触发驱逐，且仅在 `usedSize * 100 > totalSize * threshold` 时触发。启用"
" SSD 时，建议设置为 70 以提高 SSD 缓存命中率。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.evict_threshold_low` | int | 80 | No | [1, 98] (percentage) | Low"
" watermark of the secondary (L2) pool; eviction stops at this watermark. "
"When SSD is enabled, 60 is recommended. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.evict_threshold_low` | int | 80 | 否 | [1, 98]（百分比） | "
"二级（L2）池的低水位线；驱逐在该水位线停止。启用 SSD 时，建议设置为 60。 |"

msgid "##### mmc-local.conf"
msgstr "##### mmc-local.conf"

msgid ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>mmc-local.conf Parameters</summary>"
msgstr ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>mmc-local.conf 参数</summary>"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.meta_service_url` | str | tcp://127.0.0.1:5000 | No | "
"tcp://<host>:<port>, port [1025, 65535] | Must match mmc-meta.conf (host is "
"cluster-ip or domain in HA deployments). |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.meta_service_url` | str | tcp://127.0.0.1:5000 | 否 | "
"tcp://<host>:<port>，端口 [1025, 65535] | 必须与 mmc-meta.conf 匹配（在 HA 部署中 host 为 "
"cluster-ip 或域名）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.config_store_url` | str | tcp://127.0.0.1:6000 | No"
" | tcp://<host>:<port>, port [1025, 65535] | Must match "
"`ock.mmc.meta_service.config_store_url` in mmc-meta.conf. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.config_store_url` | str | tcp://127.0.0.1:6000 | 否 "
"| tcp://<host>:<port>，端口 [1025, 65535] | 必须与 mmc-meta.conf 中的 "
"`ock.mmc.meta_service.config_store_url` 匹配。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.world_size` | int | 256 | No | [1, 1024] | Maximum "
"number of LocalServices supported (including future additions). Once ranks "
"are connected, no further modifications are allowed — a meta restart is "
"required. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.world_size` | int | 256 | 否 | [1, 1024] | 支持的最大 "
"LocalService 数量（包括未来新增的）。一旦 rank 已连接，则不允许进一步修改——需要重启 meta。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.protocol` | str | host_rdma | Yes | host_rdma / "
"host_urma / host_tcp / host_shm / device_sdma / device_rdma / device_urma / "
"device_uboe | Communication protocol. A2 recommended: `device_rdma` (RoCE); "
"A3 HCCS recommended: `device_sdma` (requires LingQu Computing Network >= "
"1.5); 950PR&950DT Products UB: `device_urma`; UBOE: `device_uboe`. "
"`host_shm` requires DRAM > 0 and HBM = 0. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.protocol` | str | host_rdma | 是 | host_rdma / "
"host_urma / host_tcp / host_shm / device_sdma / device_rdma / device_urma / "
"device_uboe | 通信协议。A2 推荐：`device_rdma`（RoCE）；A3 HCCS "
"推荐：`device_sdma`（需要灵衢计算网络 >= 1.5）；Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品 "
"UB：`device_urma`；UBOE：`device_uboe`。`host_shm` 要求 DRAM > 0 且 HBM = 0。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` | int | 1GB | Yes | [0, 1TB], auto-"
"aligned to 2MB (`host_*` protocols) or 1GB (`device_*` protocols) | DRAM "
"size allocated per die; supports formats such as 134217728, 2048KB, 200MB, "
"2.5GB, or 1TB. For example, on A3, to allocate 640GB as KV pool, set this "
"parameter to 640/16=40GB. Set 0GB for A3 when HCCS is available. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.dram.size` | int | 1GB | 是 | [0, 1TB]，自动对齐到 "
"2MB（`host_*` 协议）或 1GB（`device_*` 协议） | 每个 die 分配的 DRAM 大小；支持 "
"134217728、2048KB、200MB、2.5GB 或 1TB 等格式。例如，在 A3 上，若要将 640GB 分配为 KV 池，请将该参数设置为"
" 640/16=40GB。当 HCCS 可用时，A3 请设置为 0GB。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` | int | 1TB | No | [0, 1TB] | "
"Maximum DRAM size. Needed when ranks contribute different sizes of DRAM. The"
" default 1TB is binary 1024^4 bytes. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` | int | 1TB | 否 | [0, 1TB] | 最大 DRAM"
" 大小。当各 rank 贡献的 DRAM 大小不同时需要设置。默认值 1TB 为二进制 1024^4 字节。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.storage.enabled` | bool | false | No | true / false"
" | Enable SSD caching. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ock.mmc.local_service.storage.enabled` | bool | false | 否 | true / false "
"| 启用 SSD 缓存。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ubsio.disk.path` | str | No default | Required when SSD enabled | "
"Absolute paths, multiple paths separated by `:` | SSD block device, "
"partition, or loop device paths. Devices must be dedicated with no mount "
"points or filesystem signatures. `/dev/sd*` not recommended. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ubsio.disk.path` | str | 无默认值 | 启用 SSD 时必填 | 绝对路径，多个路径以 `:` 分隔 | SSD "
"块设备、分区或 loop 设备路径。设备必须专用，且没有挂载点或文件系统签名。不建议使用 `/dev/sd*`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` | int | 10 | No | Integer [0, 3072]; SSD cache "
"requires >= 5 | DRAM size requested by UBS IO per die (i.e., per "
"LocalService/process), in GB. Data storage flow: HBM → second-level pooled "
"DRAM → third-level pooled DRAM → SSD. The total allocation must not exceed "
"the node memory available after reserving memory for the operating system, "
"vLLM, and the Memcache DRAM pool. Typically 10; 50 recommended for separated"
" deployment. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` | int | 10 | 否 | 整数 [0, 3072]；SSD 缓存要求 >= 5 | UBS "
"IO 为每个 die（即每个 LocalService/进程）申请的 DRAM 大小，单位为 GB。数据存储流程：HBM → 二级池化 DRAM → "
"三级池化 DRAM → SSD。总分配量不得超过为操作系统、vLLM 和 Memcache DRAM 池预留内存后节点可用的内存。通常为 "
"10；分离部署时建议为 50。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ubsio.standalone.device_count` | int | No default | Yes | Positive "
"integer | Number of DRAM-enabled LocalServices, i.e., the number of vLLM "
"processes on the environment (8 on A2, 16 on A3; if fewer cards are actually"
" used, configure the actual process count, e.g., 4 when only 4 cards are "
"occupied). |"
msgstr ""
"| `ubsio.standalone.device_count` | int | 无默认值 | 是 | 正整数 | 启用 DRAM 的 "
"LocalService 数量，即环境中 vLLM 进程的数量（A2 上为 8，A3 上为 16；如果实际使用的卡数较少，请配置实际的进程数，例如仅占用"
" 4 张卡时配置为 4）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `ubsio.standalone.force_new_disk` | bool | true | No | true / false | "
"Clears the mounted disks each time the service is started. The current "
"version does not support fault recovery; keeping true is recommended. |"
msgstr ""
"| `ubsio.standalone.force_new_disk` | bool | true | 否 | true / false | "
"每次启动服务时清除已挂载的磁盘。当前版本不支持故障恢复；建议保持为 true。 |"

