msgid "#### Step 7: Memcache and vLLM Separated Deployment"
msgstr "#### 步骤 7：Memcache 与 vLLM 分离部署"

msgid ""
"This deployment mode runs MemCache and vLLM in different processes (distinct"
" from vLLM PD disaggregation). In the default co-located mode, vLLM loads "
"the model weights before the KV connector initializes MemCache, so MemCache "
"may not be able to reserve sufficient memory from the remaining available "
"space. Starting a standalone MemCache process before vLLM allows MemCache to"
" reserve a larger memory pool."
msgstr ""
"此部署模式将 MemCache 和 vLLM 运行在不同的进程中（与 vLLM PD 分离不同）。在默认的同进程部署模式下，vLLM 会在 KV "
"连接器初始化 MemCache 之前加载模型权重，因此 MemCache 可能无法从剩余可用空间中预留足够的内存。在 vLLM 之前启动独立的 "
"MemCache 进程，可以让 MemCache 预留更大的内存池。"

msgid ""
"Prepare two LocalService configuration files with the same connection and "
"protocol settings: the configuration used by the vLLM process does not "
"contribute DRAM (`dram.size = 0GB`), and the configuration used by the "
"standalone MemCache process specifies the amount of DRAM to contribute. Set "
"`ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` to accommodate the maximum `dram.size`"
" used by the LocalService processes."
msgstr ""
"准备两个具有相同连接和协议设置的 LocalService 配置文件：vLLM 进程使用的配置不贡献 DRAM（`dram.size = "
"0GB`），独立 MemCache 进程使用的配置指定要贡献的 DRAM 大小。将 "
"`ock.mmc.local_service.max.dram.size` 设置为能够容纳 LocalService 进程使用的最大 "
"`dram.size`。"

msgid "Steps:"
msgstr "步骤："

msgid ""
"1. Start MetaService (same as above).\n"
"2. Use the following `mmc-local-standalone.conf` configuration to start an independent Memcache process on each node:"
msgstr ""
"1. 启动 MetaService（同上）。\n"
"2. 使用以下 `mmc-local-standalone.conf` 配置在每个节点上启动独立的 Memcache 进程："

msgid ""
"3. Wait for all nodes to report successful initialization.\n"
"4. Use the following `mmc-local.conf` configuration (`dram.size = 0GB`) to start vLLM:"
msgstr ""
"3. 等待所有节点报告初始化成功。\n"
"4. 使用以下 `mmc-local.conf` 配置（`dram.size = 0GB`）启动 vLLM："

msgid ""
"Startup script reference: [Memcache + vLLM + A3 Separated Deployment "
"Case](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/MemCache+vLLM+A3%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B.md)"
msgstr ""
"启动脚本参考：[Memcache + vLLM + A3 "
"分离部署案例](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/MemCache+vLLM+A3%E5%88%86%E7%A6%BB%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B.md)"

msgid "#### Step 8: Enable Memcache SSD Cache"
msgstr "#### 步骤 8：启用 Memcache SSD 缓存"

msgid ""
"When enabling SSD Cache in the separated deployment scenario, refer to the "
"following configurations:"
msgstr "在分离部署场景中启用 SSD 缓存时，请参考以下配置："

msgid "##### mmc-local.conf (used by the vLLM process, contributing no DRAM)"
msgstr "##### mmc-local.conf（由 vLLM 进程使用，不贡献 DRAM）"

msgid ""
"##### mmc-local-standalone.conf (used by the standalone MemCache process)"
msgstr "##### mmc-local-standalone.conf（由独立 MemCache 进程使用）"

msgid ""
"When adjusting `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb`, calculate the maximum permitted per-"
"process value by dividing the node memory available to UBS IO by the number "
"of DRAM-enabled local services, rounding down, and capping the result at "
"`3072`:"
msgstr ""
"调整 `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` 时，将节点可供 UBS IO 使用的内存除以启用 DRAM "
"的本地服务数量，向下取整，并将结果上限设为 `3072`，以计算每个进程允许的最大值："

msgid ""
"For example, if `200` GB is available to UBS IO and four local services have"
" DRAM enabled, the upper limit is `50` GB per process. If the calculated "
"upper limit is less than `5`, free more node memory or reduce the number of "
"DRAM-enabled local services."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果 UBS IO 可用内存为 `200` GB，且有四个本地服务启用了 DRAM，则每个进程的上限为 `50` GB。如果计算出的上限小于 "
"`5`，请释放更多节点内存或减少启用 DRAM 的本地服务数量。"

msgid ""
"For the scenario of separate deployment of MemCache, it is recommended to "
"configure a single process with `50` GB. In other scenarios, the recommended"
" value is `10` GB. If you want to use the L2.5 memory caching capability, "
"increase `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` within the limits above and adjust "
"[ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)"
" accordingly."
msgstr ""
"对于 MemCache 分离部署场景，建议将单个进程配置为 `50` GB。在其他场景中，建议值为 `10` GB。如果要使用 L2.5 "
"内存缓存能力，请在上述限制范围内增加 `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb`，并相应调整 "
"[ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)。"

msgid "### Scenario 3: Yuanrong Backend"
msgstr "### 场景 3：Yuanrong 后端"

msgid "#### Step 1: Install Yuanrong Datasystem"
msgstr "#### 步骤 1：安装 Yuanrong Datasystem"

msgid "Expected output:"
msgstr "预期输出："

msgid ""
"- `Yuanrong Datasystem is ready`\n"
"- Version number displayed by `dscli`."
msgstr ""
"- `Yuanrong Datasystem is ready`\n"
"- `dscli` 显示的版本号。"

msgid ""
"If the prebuilt package does not match the CANN or driver version, build "
"Yuanrong Datasystem from source: [Yuanrong "
"Datasystem](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-datasystem)."
msgstr ""
"如果预编译包与 CANN 或驱动版本不匹配，请从源码构建 Yuanrong Datasystem：[Yuanrong "
"Datasystem](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-datasystem)。"

msgid "#### Step 2: Choose a Service Discovery Backend"
msgstr "#### 步骤 2：选择服务发现后端"

msgid "##### Option 1: Start Coordinator"
msgstr "##### 方案 1：启动 Coordinator"

msgid "Expected output: `Start coordinator service ... success`."
msgstr "预期输出：`Start coordinator service ... success`。"

msgid "Single-node quick start (Coordinator + Worker in one step):"
msgstr "单节点快速开始（一步启动 Coordinator + Worker）："

msgid "##### Option 2: Start etcd"
msgstr "##### 方案 2：启动 etcd"

msgid ""
"Expected output: `etcdctl put key \"value\"` returns `OK`; `etcdctl get key`"
" returns `key`->`value`."
msgstr ""
"预期输出：`etcdctl put key \"value\"` 返回 `OK`；`etcdctl get key` 返回 "
"`key`->`value`。"

msgid ""
"For production environments, refer to the official etcd clustering "
"documentation: [etcd clustering guide](https://etcd.io/docs/v3.7/op-"
"guide/clustering/)."
msgstr ""
"对于生产环境，请参考 etcd 官方集群文档：[etcd 集群指南](https://etcd.io/docs/v3.7/op-"
"guide/clustering/)。"

msgid "##### Multi-node deployment"
msgstr "##### 多节点部署"

msgid ""
"Install Yuanrong Datasystem on every node. Each node runs one Datasystem "
"Worker with a unique, reachable `worker_address`. All Workers must use the "
"same service discovery backend and backend address."
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上安装 Yuanrong Datasystem。每个节点运行一个 Datasystem Worker，并使用唯一且可访问的 "
"`worker_address`。所有 Worker 必须使用相同的服务发现后端和后端地址。"

msgid ""
"Multi-node deployment with Coordinator (example with Coordinator node "
"address `192.168.1.10`):"
msgstr "使用 Coordinator 的多节点部署（以 Coordinator 节点地址 `192.168.1.10` 为例）："

msgid ""
"Multi-node deployment with etcd: start an etcd service or cluster that every"
" Worker can reach, then start one Worker on every node. Set `WORKER_IP` to "
"that node's own IP and keep `ETCD_ADDRESS` identical on all nodes:"
msgstr ""
"使用 etcd 的多节点部署：启动一个所有 Worker 都能访问的 etcd 服务或集群，然后在每个节点上启动一个 Worker。将 "
"`WORKER_IP` 设置为该节点自身的 IP，并确保所有节点上的 `ETCD_ADDRESS` 保持一致："

msgid ""
"- Do not use `127.0.0.1` or `0.0.0.0` as a Worker address in a multi-node deployment. Other Workers must be able to connect to the advertised IP.\n"
"- Allow network access to the Coordinator port (`31511`) or etcd client port (`2379`), and to every Worker port (`31501` in these examples).\n"
"- On each node, set `worker_addr` in `yuanrong.json` to that node's local `WORKER_IP:31501`. The configuration file therefore differs by node."
msgstr ""
"- 在多节点部署中，不要使用 `127.0.0.1` 或 `0.0.0.0` 作为 Worker 地址。其他 Worker 必须能够连接到所公布的 IP。\n"
"- 允许对 Coordinator 端口（`31511`）或 etcd 客户端端口（`2379`）以及每个 Worker 端口（这些示例中为 `31501`）的网络访问。\n"
"- 在每个节点上，将 `yuanrong.json` 中的 `worker_addr` 设置为该节点本地的 `WORKER_IP:31501`。因此配置文件因节点而异。"

msgid ""
"For production control-plane high availability, deploy multiple Coordinators"
" with static Raft peers, a unique `coordinator_address` and "
"`coordinator_raft_data_dir` for each Coordinator, and the same "
"`coordinator_raft_initial_peers` list. See the [Yuanrong Datasystem dscli "
"documentation](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-"
"datasystem/blob/master/docs/source_zh_cn/deployment/dscli.md#coordinator-%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2)."
msgstr ""
"对于生产环境控制平面的高可用，请部署多个 Coordinator，使用静态 Raft 对等节点，为每个 Coordinator 设置唯一的 "
"`coordinator_address` 和 `coordinator_raft_data_dir`，并使用相同的 "
"`coordinator_raft_initial_peers` 列表。请参阅 [Yuanrong Datasystem dscli "
"文档](https://atomgit.com/openeuler/yuanrong-"
"datasystem/blob/master/docs/source_zh_cn/deployment/dscli.md#coordinator-%E5%A4%9A%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2)。"

msgid "#### Step 3: Start Datasystem Worker"
msgstr "#### 步骤 3：启动 Datasystem Worker"

msgid ""
"Expected output: Worker starts successfully with no errors. Worker logs, "
"including files whose base name is normally `datasystem_worker`, are written"
" under the `--log_dir` directory. Use an absolute path so the log location "
"does not depend on the worker process's current directory."
msgstr ""
"预期输出：Worker 成功启动且无错误。Worker 日志（包括基本名称通常为 `datasystem_worker` 的文件）写入 "
"`--log_dir` 目录下。请使用绝对路径，以便日志位置不依赖于 worker 进程的当前目录。"

msgid ""
"The `--worker_address` value is consumed later as `worker_addr` in "
"`yuanrong.json`, so keep the host and port identical on the same node. "
"Configure only one coordination backend for a Worker: when using "
"Coordinator, do not also set `etcd_address` or `metastore_address`."
msgstr ""
"`--worker_address` 的值稍后会作为 `yuanrong.json` 中的 `worker_addr` "
"使用，因此请确保同一节点上的主机和端口保持一致。为 Worker 仅配置一个协调后端：使用 Coordinator 时，不要再设置 "
"`etcd_address` 或 `metastore_address`。"

msgid ""
"Stop the Worker when it is no longer needed. Stop the selected service "
"discovery backend only after all Workers have stopped. For an independent "
"etcd cluster, follow its normal cluster maintenance procedure:"
msgstr ""
"当不再需要时停止 Worker。仅在所有 Worker 停止后，才停止所选的服务发现后端。对于独立的 etcd 集群，请遵循其常规集群维护流程："

msgid ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>Yuanrong dscli Worker Parameters</summary>"
msgstr ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>Yuanrong dscli Worker 参数</summary>"

msgid ""
"| `worker_address` | str | No default | Yes | `<host>:<port>` | Worker "
"address, must match `yuanrong.json` `worker_addr`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `worker_address` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | `<host>:<port>` | Worker 地址，必须与 "
"`yuanrong.json` 的 `worker_addr` 匹配。 |"

msgid ""
"| `coordinator_address` | str | No default | Option 1 | `<ip>:31511` | "
"Coordinator address. |"
msgstr ""
"| `coordinator_address` | str | 无默认值 | 方案 1 | `<ip>:31511` | Coordinator 地址。"
" |"

msgid ""
"| `etcd_address` | str | No default | Option 2 | `<ip>:2379` | etcd address."
" |"
msgstr "| `etcd_address` | str | 无默认值 | 方案 2 | `<ip>:2379` | etcd 地址。 |"

msgid ""
"| `log_dir` | str | No default | No | Absolute path | Worker log directory, "
"use absolute path. Create the directory and grant the worker process write "
"permission before startup. |"
msgstr ""
"| `log_dir` | str | 无默认值 | 否 | 绝对路径 | Worker 日志目录，请使用绝对路径。启动前创建该目录并授予 worker"
" 进程写权限。 |"

msgid ""
"| `shared_memory_size_mb` | int | No default | Yes | Positive integer (MB) |"
" Shared memory size (MB). Example: 40960 (40 GB). |"
msgstr ""
"| `shared_memory_size_mb` | int | 无默认值 | 是 | 正整数（MB） | "
"共享内存大小（MB）。示例：40960（40 GB）。 |"

msgid ""
"| `arena_per_tenant` | int | No default | No | Positive integer | Shared "
"memory arena count per tenant. Conservative starting point: 1. |"
msgstr ""
"| `arena_per_tenant` | int | 无默认值 | 否 | 正整数 | 每个租户的共享内存 arena 数量。保守的起始值：1。 |"

msgid ""
"| `enable_huge_tlb` | bool | No default | No | true / false | Use HugeTLB "
"pages for shared memory. Reserve enough 2 MiB huge pages before starting the"
" worker. |"
msgstr ""
"| `enable_huge_tlb` | bool | 无默认值 | 否 | true / false | 为共享内存使用 HugeTLB 页。启动 "
"worker 前预留足够的 2 MiB 大页。 |"

msgid ""
"| `enable_fallocate` | bool | No default | No | true / false | Execute "
"fallocate for shared memory file. Recommended false with HugeTLB. |"
msgstr ""
"| `enable_fallocate` | bool | 无默认值 | 否 | true / false | 对共享内存文件执行 "
"fallocate。使用 HugeTLB 时建议设为 false。 |"

msgid ""
"| `rpc_thread_num` | int | No default | No | Positive integer | RPC/ZMQ "
"service concurrency. |"
msgstr "| `rpc_thread_num` | int | 无默认值 | 否 | 正整数 | RPC/ZMQ 服务并发数。 |"

msgid ""
"| `oc_thread_num` | int | No default | No | Positive integer | Object Cache "
"business thread pool size. |"
msgstr "| `oc_thread_num` | int | 无默认值 | 否 | 正整数 | Object Cache 业务线程池大小。 |"

msgid ""
"| `enable_worker_worker_batch_get` | bool | No default | No | true / false |"
" Enable batched Object Cache reads between Workers. |"
msgstr ""
"| `enable_worker_worker_batch_get` | bool | 无默认值 | 否 | true / false | 启用 "
"Worker 之间的批量 Object Cache 读取。 |"

msgid ""
"| `sc_regular_socket_num` | int | 0 | No | >= 0 | Stream Cache regular "
"socket count. Keep at 0 when KV Pool does not use Stream Cache. |"
msgstr ""
"| `sc_regular_socket_num` | int | 0 | 否 | >= 0 | Stream Cache 常规 socket 数量。当"
" KV Pool 不使用 Stream Cache 时保持为 0。 |"

msgid ""
"| `sc_stream_socket_num` | int | 0 | No | >= 0 | Stream Cache stream socket "
"count. Keep at 0 when KV Pool does not use Stream Cache. |"
msgstr ""
"| `sc_stream_socket_num` | int | 0 | 否 | >= 0 | Stream Cache 流式 socket 数量。当 "
"KV Pool 不使用 Stream Cache 时保持为 0。 |"

msgid ""
"| `remote_h2d_device_ids` | str | empty | No | Comma-separated device IDs, "
"e.g., `\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"` | Non-empty enables worker-side Remote H2D. "
"Using multiple available NPU device IDs is recommended. |"
msgstr ""
"| `remote_h2d_device_ids` | str | 空 | 否 | 逗号分隔的设备 ID，例如 "
"`\"0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7\"` | 非空时启用 worker 侧的 Remote H2D。建议使用多个可用的 NPU 设备 ID。 |"

msgid ""
"| `remote_h2d_link_type` | str | ROCE | No | ROCE / HCCS (case-sensitive) | "
"Link type. `ROCE` maps to client `P2P_TRANSFER`; `HCCS` maps to client "
"`HIXL` (covers buffer-pool, HIXL RoCE direct, and FabricMem sub-modes). For "
"`HCCS`, the client process must also export `DS_RH2D_LINK_TYPE=HCCS` before "
"starting vLLM (the backend does not export it automatically); `ROCE` is the "
"datasystem default and needs no env var. |"
msgstr ""
"| `remote_h2d_link_type` | str | ROCE | 否 | ROCE / HCCS（区分大小写） | 链路类型。`ROCE`"
" 映射到客户端 `P2P_TRANSFER`；`HCCS` 映射到客户端 `HIXL`（涵盖 buffer-pool、HIXL RoCE direct "
"和 FabricMem 子模式）。对于 `HCCS`，客户端进程还必须在启动 vLLM 前导出 "
"`DS_RH2D_LINK_TYPE=HCCS`（后端不会自动导出）；`ROCE` 是 datasystem 的默认值，无需环境变量。 |"

msgid ""
"| `remote_h2d_hccs_buffer_pool` | str | 4:8 | No | `<count>:<size>` | HIXL "
"buffer-pool parameter, only used when `link_type=HCCS`. Ignored under HIXL "
"RoCE direct mode (`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`). |"
msgstr ""
"| `remote_h2d_hccs_buffer_pool` | str | 4:8 | 否 | `<count>:<size>` | HIXL "
"缓冲池参数，仅在 `link_type=HCCS` 时使用。在 HIXL RoCE "
"直连模式（`HCCL_INTRA_ROCE_ENABLE=1`）下忽略。 |"

msgid "#### Step 4: Configure Environment Variables and `yuanrong.json`"
msgstr "#### 步骤 4：配置环境变量和 `yuanrong.json`"

msgid ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>Yuanrong Environment Variables</summary>"
msgstr ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>Yuanrong 环境变量</summary>"

msgid "| `Variable` | Type | Default | Required | Value Range | Description |"
msgstr "| `变量` | 类型 | 默认值 | 是否必填 | 取值范围 | 描述 |"

msgid ""
"| `PYTHONHASHSEED` | int | 0 | Yes | Integer (consistent across all nodes) |"
" Must be consistent across all nodes to guarantee uniform hash generation. |"
msgstr ""
"| `PYTHONHASHSEED` | int | 0 | 是 | 整数（所有节点保持一致） | 必须在所有节点上保持一致，以保证哈希生成的一致性。 "
"|"

msgid ""
"| `DS_WORKER_ADDR` | str | N/A | Yes | `<host>:<port>` | Datasystem Worker "
