"| `comm_resource_config.protocol_desc` | Array of strings | No default | No "
"| e.g., `[\"hccs:device\"]`, `[\"roce:device\"]`, `[\"uboe:device\"]` | "
"Protocol descriptor for the top-level Mooncake transfer engine. In PD "
"disaggregation, this controls the `MooncakeConnectorV1` PD transfer path. |"
msgstr ""
"| `comm_resource_config.protocol_desc` | 字符串数组 | 无默认值 | 否 | 例如 "
"`[\"hccs:device\"]`、`[\"roce:device\"]`、`[\"uboe:device\"]` | 顶层 Mooncake "
"传输引擎的协议描述符。在 PD 分离中，它控制 `MooncakeConnectorV1` 的 PD 传输路径。 |"

msgid ""
"| `store.comm_resource_config.protocol_desc` | Array of strings | No default"
" | No | e.g., `[\"roce:device\"]` | Protocol descriptor for Mooncake Store "
"traffic used by `AscendStoreConnector`. On A3, this can be set to "
"`[\"roce:device\"]` while PD transfer uses HCCS. |"
msgstr ""
"| `store.comm_resource_config.protocol_desc` | 字符串数组 | 无默认值 | 否 | 例如 "
"`[\"roce:device\"]` | `AscendStoreConnector` 使用的 Mooncake Store 流量的协议描述符。在 "
"A3 上，可将其设置为 `[\"roce:device\"]`，而 PD 传输使用 HCCS。 |"

msgid ""
"| `comm_resource_config.listen_port` | int | 16666 | No | Port number | One-"
"sided communication listen port. Use a different port for standalone "
"`mooncake_client` processes to avoid conflicts with embedded clients. |"
msgstr ""
"| `comm_resource_config.listen_port` | int | 16666 | 否 | 端口号 | "
"单边通信监听端口。对于独立的 `mooncake_client` 进程，请使用不同的端口，以避免与嵌入式客户端冲突。 |"

msgid ""
"| `fabric_memory.max_capacity` | int | No default | Only when fabric mem "
"budget is insufficient | Integer (GB per process) | Fabric memory quota. |"
msgstr ""
"| `fabric_memory.max_capacity` | int | 无默认值 | 仅在 fabric 内存预算不足时 | 整数（每个进程的 "
"GB 数） | Fabric 内存配额。 |"

