msgid "## Configuration Parameters"
msgstr "## 配置参数"

msgid ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>kv-transfer-config Common Parameters</summary>"
msgstr ""
"<details markdown=\"1\">\n"
"<summary>kv-transfer-config 通用参数</summary>"

msgid ""
"| `kv_load_failure_policy` | str | fail | No | recompute / fail | Behavior "
"when KV loading fails: `recompute` rolls back and recomputes (does not yet "
"support hybrid attention models like DeepSeekV4, Qwen 3.5), `fail` "
"terminates the request. When using MultiConnector, configure on the top-"
"level `kv-transfer-config`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `kv_load_failure_policy` | str | fail | 否 | recompute / fail | KV "
"加载失败时的行为：`recompute` 回滚并重新计算（暂不支持 DeepSeekV4、Qwen 3.5 等混合注意力模型），`fail` "
"终止请求。使用 MultiConnector 时，在顶层 `kv-transfer-config` 中配置。 |"

msgid ""
"| `lookup_rpc_port` | str | No default | Yes | Unique port number (e.g., "
"\"0\", \"1\") | RPC port between pooling scheduler and worker processes. "
"Each instance must use a unique port. The legacy name `mooncake_rpc_port` is"
" deprecated; use `lookup_rpc_port`. |"
msgstr ""
"| `lookup_rpc_port` | str | 无默认值 | 是 | 唯一端口号（例如 \"0\"、\"1\"） | 池化调度器与 worker"
" 进程之间的 RPC 端口。每个实例必须使用唯一端口。旧名称 `mooncake_rpc_port` 已废弃，请使用 "
"`lookup_rpc_port`。 |"

msgid ""
"| `load_async` | bool | false | No | true / false | Whether to enable "
"asynchronous loading. |"
msgstr "| `load_async` | bool | false | 否 | true / false | 是否启用异步加载。 |"

