msgid "## Tuning Recommendations"
msgstr "## 调优建议"

msgid "### Mooncake SSD Offload Parameter Tuning"
msgstr "### Mooncake SSD 卸载参数调优"

msgid ""
"- Increase `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` when `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` occurs, but do not exceed the `Available KV cache memory` value in vLLM Worker logs. Use byte literals only (e.g., `10737418240`); `10G`/`10GB` is not supported.\n"
"- On A3 with `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1`, `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` must be aligned to 1 GB (multiple of 1073741824); avoid unaligned values such as `1280MB`, `512MB`, or `1.5GB`. `local_buffer_size` in `mooncake.json` is not used under fabric mem mode.\n"
"- Fabric mem budget formula (per rank):"
msgstr ""
"- 当出现 `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` 时，增大 `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES`，但不要超过 vLLM Worker 日志中的 `Available KV cache memory` 值。仅使用字节字面量（例如 `10737418240`）；不支持 `10G`/`10GB`。\n"
"- 在 A3 上启用 `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` 时，`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 必须按 1 GB 对齐（1073741824 的倍数）；避免使用 `1280MB`、`512MB` 或 `1.5GB` 等未对齐的值。在 fabric mem 模式下，`mooncake.json` 中的 `local_buffer_size` 不会被使用。\n"
"- Fabric mem 预算公式（每个 rank）："

msgid ""
"If quota is insufficient, some ranks may fail with `Memory_Allocation_Failure(EL0004)` after `global_segment_size` succeeds but `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` allocation fails.\n"
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` defaults to 2 TB which far exceeds real disk capacity. Always set it to the actual per-rank budget. For example, with 800 GB disk and 8 TP ranks:"
msgstr ""
"如果配额不足，某些 rank 可能在 `global_segment_size` 成功后，因 `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 分配失败而报错 `Memory_Allocation_Failure(EL0004)`。\n"
"- `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_TOTAL_SIZE_LIMIT_BYTES` 默认为 2 TB，远超实际磁盘容量。请始终将其设置为每个 rank 的实际预算。例如，对于 800 GB 磁盘和 8 个 TP rank："

msgid "- Host memory budget:"
msgstr "- 主机内存预算："

msgid ""
"- Verify after tuning: each rank prints `AlignedClientBufferAllocator: "
"allocated <N> bytes` at startup; no `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` / `Failed to get ... "
"keys out of ... error_codes=[-10]` under load. If failures persist with a "
"large buffer, check overlapping loads (`load_async`)."
msgstr ""
"- 调优后验证：每个 rank 在启动时打印 `AlignedClientBufferAllocator: allocated <N> "
"bytes`；在负载下无 `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` / `Failed to get ... keys out of ... "
"error_codes=[-10]`。如果使用大缓冲区仍持续失败，请检查重叠加载（`load_async`）。"

msgid "### MooncakeStore Warm-up"
msgstr "### MooncakeStore 预热"

msgid ""
"For MooncakeStore with `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL` enabled, perform a warm-up phase"
" before running actual performance benchmarks. Since HCCS one-sided "
"communication connections are created lazily after instance launch, full-"
"mesh connections incur a one-time overhead (4 MB device memory per "
"connection). Warm-up recommendation: input sequence length 8k, output "
"sequence length 1, total requests 2-3x number of devices."
msgstr ""
"对于启用了 `ASCEND_BUFFER_POOL` 的 MooncakeStore，在运行实际性能基准测试之前，请先执行预热阶段。由于 HCCS "
"单边通信连接在实例启动后才会延迟创建，全互联连接会产生一次性开销（每个连接 4 MB 设备内存）。预热建议：输入序列长度 8k，输出序列长度 "
"1，总请求数为设备数量的 2-3 倍。"

msgid "### Memcache UBS IO Memory Pool Tuning"
msgstr "### Memcache UBS IO 内存池调优"

msgid "- `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` upper limit formula:"
msgstr "- `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` 上限公式："

msgid ""
"- Separated deployment recommended: 50 GB per process; other scenarios: 10 GB.\n"
"- To use L2.5 memory caching, increase `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb` within the limit and adjust [ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)."
msgstr ""
"- 推荐分离部署：每个进程 50 GB；其他场景：10 GB。\n"
"- 要使用 L2.5 内存缓存，请在限制范围内增大 `ubsio.mem.size_in_gb`，并调整 [ubsio.wcache.evict_water_level](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/DRAM%20+%20SSD%20%E5%A4%9A%E7%BA%A7%E6%B1%A0%E5%8C%96%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#ubsiowcacheevict_water_level)。"

