msgid "### Issue 1: failed to put/get key"
msgstr "### 问题 1：put/get key 失败"

msgid ""
"**Problem Description:** vLLM reports failed `put` or `get` operations."
msgstr "**问题描述：** vLLM 报错 `put` 或 `get` 操作失败。"

msgid ""
"**Root Cause Analysis:** First determine whether the error is reported by "
"Mooncake itself:"
msgstr "**根因分析：** 首先判断该错误是否由 Mooncake 自身报出："

msgid ""
"- `put` failure: Mooncake log shows `NO_AVAILABLE_HANDLE` or `BatchPut failed ... due to insufficient space`. This usually means the remaining space after eviction is not enough for one `BatchPut` request.\n"
"- `get` failure: Mooncake log shows `lease_expired_before_data_transfer_completed key=...` or returns `LEASE_EXPIRED`. The KV object lease expired before data transfer completed."
msgstr ""
"- `put` 失败：Mooncake 日志显示 `NO_AVAILABLE_HANDLE` 或 `BatchPut failed ... due to insufficient space`。这通常意味着驱逐后剩余空间不足以容纳一次 `BatchPut` 请求。\n"
"- `get` 失败：Mooncake 日志显示 `lease_expired_before_data_transfer_completed key=...` 或返回 `LEASE_EXPIRED`。KV 对象租约在数据传输完成前已过期。"

msgid "**Resolution Steps:**"
msgstr "**解决步骤：**"

msgid ""
"1. Identify the error source. If Mooncake-reported `put` failure, ensure eviction policy remaining space (e.g., `1 - eviction_ratio`) can hold one batch put, or increase capacity, increase eviction headroom, or reduce batch size.\n"
"2. If `get` failure, increase `mooncake_master` `--default_kv_lease_ttl` and keep it larger than `ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT` and `ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT`.\n"
"3. If not Mooncake-reported, it is likely an HIXL (ascend_direct) transfer-layer issue. Collect plog files under `/root/ascend/log/debug/plog` for investigation."
msgstr ""
"1. 确定错误来源。如果是 Mooncake 报出的 `put` 失败，请确保驱逐策略的剩余空间（例如 `1 - eviction_ratio`）能够容纳一次批量 put，或者增加容量、增加驱逐预留空间，或减小批量大小。\n"
"2. 如果是 `get` 失败，请增大 `mooncake_master` 的 `--default_kv_lease_ttl`，并使其大于 `ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT` 和 `ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT`。\n"
"3. 如果不是 Mooncake 报出的错误，则很可能是 HIXL（ascend_direct）传输层问题。请收集 `/root/ascend/log/debug/plog` 下的 plog 文件进行排查。"

msgid "### Issue 2: `SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND` (SSD Offload)"
msgstr "### 问题 2：`SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND`（SSD Offload）"

msgid ""
"**Problem Description:** Client logs show `OffloadObjectHeartbeat failed, "
"error code is SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND`. The rank's SSD Offload stops until the "
"segment is registered again."
msgstr ""
"**问题描述：** 客户端日志显示 `OffloadObjectHeartbeat failed, error code is "
"SEGMENT_NOT_FOUND`。该 rank 的 SSD Offload 会停止，直到该 segment 重新注册。"

msgid ""
"**Root Cause Analysis:** Master has unmounted the rank's `LOCAL_DISK` "
"segment (typically after `client_expired` when Ping stops refreshing TTL). "
"Common trigger when `enable_cpu_binding=true`: Mooncake starts Ping during "
"init, then vLLM-Ascend `bind_cpus()` runs `migratepages`/IRQ binding; the "
"Ping thread is not pinned and misses beats under default `client_ttl=10`."
msgstr ""
"**根因分析：** Master 已卸载该 rank 的 `LOCAL_DISK` segment（通常发生在 `client_expired` "
"之后，此时 Ping 停止刷新 TTL）。在 `enable_cpu_binding=true` 时常见的触发场景：Mooncake 在初始化期间启动 "
"Ping，随后 vLLM-Ascend 的 `bind_cpus()` 执行 `migratepages`/IRQ 绑定；Ping 线程未被绑定，在默认"
" `client_ttl=10` 下会错过心跳。"

msgid ""
"1. Temporary: raise Master TTL, e.g., `mooncake_master ... --client_ttl=120`. Tune to your init/warmup window (60-120 is often enough).\n"
"2. Recovery: upgrade Mooncake to > v0.3.11 (main branch) which can remount `LOCAL_DISK` and rescan metadata.\n"
"3. Root fix: pin the storage Ping thread to a release/isolated CPU (Mooncake-side change).\n"
"4. When debugging restarts, restart Master together with vLLM to avoid stale `segment_already_exists` state."
msgstr ""
"1. 临时方案：增大 Master TTL，例如 `mooncake_master ... --client_ttl=120`。根据你的初始化/预热窗口进行调整（60-120 通常足够）。\n"
"2. 恢复方案：将 Mooncake 升级到 > v0.3.11（main 分支），该版本可以重新挂载 `LOCAL_DISK` 并重新扫描元数据。\n"
"3. 根本修复：将存储 Ping 线程绑定到 release/isolated CPU（Mooncake 侧改动）。\n"
"4. 调试重启时，请将 Master 与 vLLM 一起重启，以避免残留的 `segment_already_exists` 状态。"

msgid "### Issue 3: Fabric Memory Misalignment Causing Allocation Failure"
msgstr "### 问题 3：Fabric 内存未对齐导致分配失败"

msgid ""
"**Problem Description:** `adxl MallocMem` / `aclrtMapMem` reports "
"`Invalid_Argument`. With SSD offload enabled, "
"`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` allocation failure may cause "
"`FileStorage init` segfault and abort vLLM startup."
msgstr ""
"**问题描述：** `adxl MallocMem` / `aclrtMapMem` 报错 `Invalid_Argument`。启用 SSD "
"offload 时，`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 分配失败可能导致 `FileStorage "
"init` 段错误，并中止 vLLM 启动。"

msgid ""
"**Root Cause Analysis:** On A3 with `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1`, each "
"fabric mem allocation must be an integer multiple of 1 GB. Mooncake does not"
" round sizes up, and the default 1280 MB (1.25 GB) is not aligned."
msgstr ""
"**根因分析：** 在 A3 上启用 `ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` 时，每次 fabric 内存分配必须是 1 GB"
" 的整数倍。Mooncake 不会向上取整，而默认的 1280 MB（1.25 GB）未对齐。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution Steps:** For buffer alignment and fabric memory quota "
"configuration, see \"Tuning Recommendations - Mooncake SSD Offload Parameter"
" Tuning\"."
msgstr ""
"**解决步骤：** 关于缓冲区对齐和 fabric 内存配额配置，请参见“调优建议 - Mooncake SSD Offload 参数调优”。"

msgid ""
"### Issue 4: `MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` Too Small "
"(`BUFFER_OVERFLOW`)"
msgstr ""
"### 问题 4：`MOONCAKE_OFFLOAD_LOCAL_BUFFER_SIZE_BYTES` 过小（`BUFFER_OVERFLOW`）"

msgid ""
"**Problem Description:** SSD reads fail with `BUFFER_OVERFLOW` "
"(`error_code=-10`) during `FileStorage::AllocateBatch`, and vLLM may fail "
"when `kv_load_failure_policy=fail`."
msgstr ""
"**问题描述：** 在 `FileStorage::AllocateBatch` 期间，SSD 读取失败并报 "
"`BUFFER_OVERFLOW`（`error_code=-10`），当 `kv_load_failure_policy=fail` 时 vLLM "
"可能会失败。"

msgid ""
"**Root Cause Analysis:** With `enable_ssd_offload=true`, Mooncake allocates "
"a separate per-rank SSD read/write buffer. This buffer is independent of "
"`global_segment_size` in `mooncake.json` — increasing the segment does not "
"fix `BUFFER_OVERFLOW`."
msgstr ""
"**根因分析：** 当 `enable_ssd_offload=true` 时，Mooncake 会为每个 rank 分配独立的 SSD "
"读写缓冲区。该缓冲区与 `mooncake.json` 中的 `global_segment_size` 无关——增大 segment 并不能解决 "
"`BUFFER_OVERFLOW`。"

msgid ""
"**Resolution Steps:** For how to increase the buffer and how to verify after"
" tuning, see \"Tuning Recommendations - Mooncake SSD Offload Parameter "
"Tuning\"."
msgstr "**解决步骤：** 关于如何增大缓冲区以及调优后如何验证，请参见“调优建议 - Mooncake SSD Offload 参数调优”。"

msgid "### Issue 5: Memcache Related Issues"
msgstr "### 问题 5：Memcache 相关问题"

msgid ""
"Pre-operation checks (memory inspection, A3 available memory scanning, "
"950PR&950DT Products signature verification disabling and container mounts, "
"SSD disk status checks) are described in \"Step 1: Prerequisite Checks\" of "
"[Scenario 2: Memcache Backend](#scenario-2-memcache-backend). For Memcache "
"troubleshooting, refer to the [Memcache "
"FAQ](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/FAQ.md)."
msgstr ""
"操作前检查（内存检查、A3 可用内存扫描、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品签名校验禁用与容器挂载、SSD 磁盘状态检查）在[场景 "
"2：Memcache 后端](#scenario-2-memcache-backend)的“步骤 1：前置检查”中描述。Memcache 问题排查请参考"
" [Memcache FAQ](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/memcache/wiki/FAQ.md)。"

msgid "### Issue 6: DSv4 Deployment Notes"
msgstr "### 问题 6：DSv4 部署注意事项"

msgid ""
"Note the following when enabling KV Pool for DSv4. Other historical known "
"issues have been fixed (see [vllm-ascend issue "
"#9975](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9975) for "
"details):"
msgstr ""
"为 DSv4 启用 KV Pool 时请注意以下事项。其他历史已知问题已修复（详情请参见 [vllm-ascend issue "
"#9975](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/9975)）："

msgid ""
"- You must add `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` at startup; otherwise the service runs into an OOM problem during startup.\n"
"- DSv4 stores the states of all compression ratio families in full, and fully storing a sequence of 1M tokens takes about 300GB of space. This is expected and is the same behavior as upstream vLLM; further optimization depends on the vLLM community."
msgstr ""
"- 启动时必须添加 `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager`；否则服务在启动期间会遇到 OOM 问题。\n"
"- DSv4 会完整存储所有压缩比族的 state，完整存储 1M token 的序列大约需要 300GB 空间。这是预期行为，与上游 vLLM 行为一致；进一步优化取决于 vLLM 社区。"

msgid "### Issue 7: AscendStore KV Pool Known Issues (v0.23.0)"
msgstr "### 问题 7：AscendStore KV Pool 已知问题（v0.23.0）"

msgid ""
"For the v0.23.0 AscendStore KV Pool known issues, see [vllm-ascend issue "
"#12390](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/12390)."
msgstr ""
"关于 v0.23.0 AscendStore KV Pool 的已知问题，请参见 [vllm-ascend issue "
"#12390](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/issues/12390)。"
